###### PAYMENTS — modul payment saat ini (PaymentController) ######
### Base: {{baseUrl}}/payments — auth: Bearer {{token}}
### Hanya 5 route aktif di bawah. Webhook Xendit ada di xendit.http.
### Alur: PENDING ──(INTERNAL langsung PAID / webhook Xendit)──> PAID (terminal)
###         PENDING ──expire──> EXPIRED | PENDING ──fail──> FAILED
### Payment selalu menarget satu invoice (invoiceId) → nominal diteruskan via PaymentSettledEvent.
### Ini satu-satunya jalur uang (B2 ditutup): tidak ada lagi POST /invoices/{id}/payments.
### Partial pay: kirim "amount" opsional (1..sisa tagihan); tanpa amount = lunasi seluruh sisa.
### Guard: satu payment PENDING aktif per invoice (dua QRIS tidak boleh menagih tagihan yang sama).
### Field response penting: invoiceId/invoiceNumber, amount (uang masuk),
### appliedAmount (nempel ke tagihan), excessAmount (parkir/kembalian), paidAt.

### ========================================
### CREATE — jalur kasir yang benar (masuk sales.cash dashboard)
### ========================================

### Create - INTERNAL / Cash (langsung PAID; invoice otomatis ter-update via PaymentSettledEvent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "invoiceId": 1,
    "paymentProvider": "INTERNAL",
    "paymentDetail": "CASH-001"
}

### Create - XENDIT (async: status awal PENDING, tunggu webhook /payments/webhooks/xendit)
### amount = remainingAmount invoice; invoiceUrl dikembalikan di response
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "invoiceId": 1,
    "paymentProvider": "XENDIT",
    "paymentDetail": "QRIS meja 3"
}

### Create - partial pay: amount opsional, harus ≤ sisa tagihan (400 "Payment amount exceeds remaining amount" bila lebih)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "invoiceId": 1,
    "paymentProvider": "INTERNAL",
    "paymentDetail": "DP meja 3",
    "amount": 20000
}

### Create - invalid: invoice sudah lunas (400 "Invoice already paid")
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "invoiceId": 1,
    "paymentProvider": "INTERNAL",
    "paymentDetail": "double pay"
}

### Create - invalid: sudah ada payment PENDING aktif untuk invoice ini (400 "Invoice already has an active pending payment")
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "invoiceId": 1,
    "paymentProvider": "XENDIT",
    "paymentDetail": "QRIS dobel"
}


### ========================================
### READ
### ========================================

### Get by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search active or GetAll
### filter: keyword, invoiceId, status (PENDING|PAID|EXPIRED|FAILED),
### paymentProvider (INTERNAL|XENDIT); default sort createdAt,desc
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search - by invoice (cek semua payment satu tagihan)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments?invoiceId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search - pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments?page=0&size=5&sort=createdAt,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================
### TRANSISI STATUS MANUAL (hanya expire / fail — PAID terminal)
### ========================================

### Mark as expired (valid: PENDING → EXPIRED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/1/expire
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark as failed (valid: PENDING → FAILED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/1/fail
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================
### VALIDATION
### ========================================

### Get by ID - not found (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expire - invalid: bukan PENDING lagi (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/1/expire
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
